# Safe change surface

## Prefer editing

- `assets/code/**/*.ts` — gameplay and helpers
- `README.md`, `.cursor/rules/**` — intent and agent guidance
- Word lists under `assets/level/words/` when changing dictionary content
- `build-templates/**` — only when changing the default web-mobile shell
- `extensions/platform-builder/` — Yandex / CrazyGames editor build commands and templates

## Edit with care

- `*.scene` / `*.prefab` — only when wiring components or layout; keep diffs minimal
- `*.meta` — do **not** create or edit; Creator generates these on import
- `assets/level/converter.py` — dictionary rebuild tool, not runtime

## Do not edit / do not commit

- `library/`, `temp/`, `local/`, `build/`, `profiles/` — Creator caches
- Engine install paths or global Cocos settings

## When scripts look “missing”

1. Read `temp/logs/project.log` (or Console) for the **first** `SyntaxError` / import failure.
2. Fix module-load crashes (storage, static init), then reload the project.
3. Reinstalling Creator rarely helps if UUIDs in `.meta` still match the scene.
